 mover e guarde o celular. Pelo GPS ele reconhece cada ponto turístico do caminho e conta a história em voz alta. Vale a pé, de bike, de carro ou no transporte público, offline e no seu idioma.\",\"url\":\"https://www.tuggi.app\",\"downloadUrl\":[\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\",\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tuggidrive.app\"],\"installUrl\":\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tuggi-drive/id6744379818\",\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.tuggidrive.app\"],\"screenshot\":\"https://www.tuggi.app/images/og-image-tuggi.jpg\",\"featureList\":[\"Self-guided audio stories that trigger automatically by GPS location\",\"Screen-off playback while you drive, walk, or cycle\",\"Works offline — download routes in advance, no roaming\",\"Audio in 10 languages with synchronized closed captions\",\"Free to start; optional Tuggi Passes of 10, 25 or 45 hours of use that do not expire\"],\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0.00\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.tuggi.app/#organization\"}}32:[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://www.tuggi.app/#organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"TUGGI\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.tuggi.app\\\",\\\"logo\\\":\\\"https://www.tuggi.app/images/logo_tuggi_full.png\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"O TUGGI conta a história de um lugar em voz alta assim que você chega perto. Funciona offline, em 10 idiomas, grátis para começar no iOS e no Android.\\\",\\\"contactPoint\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ContactPoint\\\",\\\"contactType\\\":\\\"customer support\\\",\\\"email\\\":\\\"suporte@tuggi.app\\\",\\\"availableLanguage\\\":[\\\"English\\\",\\\"Portuguese\\\",\\\"Spanish\\\"]},\\\"sameAs\\\":[\\\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/tuggi/\\\",\\\"https:/